WEBVTT

00:00:00.246 --> 00:00:00.974
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.798
Whatever, whenever, etc.

00:00:05.766 --> 00:00:06.494
1

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:09.396
<v><b>A:</b></v> What time do you want us to be there?

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:11.867
<v><b>B:</b></v> Whenever suits you, really. 7-ish?

00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:14.613
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.651 --> 00:00:17.964
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is it OK if I ask Sean and Jerry to the party?

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:21.935
<v><b>B:</b></v> Ask whoever you like, so long as it’s not more than 20-odd people.

00:00:23.977 --> 00:00:24.785
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:25.757 --> 00:00:30.007
<v><b>A:</b></v> Nice menu! I really fancy the lobster, or is it too expensive?

00:00:30.312 --> 00:00:32.827
<v><b>B:</b></v> Have whatever you like! The company’s paying.

00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:35.454
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:36.406 --> 00:00:38.293
<v><b>A:</b></v> That’s it. Checkmate.

00:00:38.528 --> 00:00:42.346
<v><b>B:</b></v> You’re so annoying. However well I play, you always win!

00:00:44.256 --> 00:00:45.053
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:47.094
<v><b>A:</b></v> Tea or coffee?

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:49.894
<v><b>B:</b></v> Whichever’s easiest. I’m happy with either.

00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:52.665
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:53.671 --> 00:00:56.054
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you know the dog’s chewing your slipper?

00:00:56.139 --> 00:01:00.020
<v><b>B:</b></v> Not again! Wherever I hide them, he always finds them.